  "description": "Primary ASP.NET Core Minimal API package for Whimclean applications: Minimal API registration with OpenAPI, FluentValidation request validation and the list query contract, consistent exception, status-code, validation, and result error responses, plus claims-based current-user resolution for any authentication scheme. The FastEndpoints package adapts these conventions to FastEndpoints.",
