  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: hosts ListQueryParser (moved from Athenex.Whimclean.Application). Primary Minimal API package: AddMinimalApi and UseMinimalApi (error handling plus OpenAPI), MapApiGroup and WithRequestValidation (FluentValidation endpoint filter), validator registration from assemblies, the ListQueryRequest contract with its validator, the shared validation failure response, a consistent 400 body for empty bad-request responses, local user resolution, liveness and readiness endpoints, per-caller rate limiting, validated options, and the configuration placeholder marker.",
